:: Widgets MP Guild Assembly [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpGuildInit">>
<<if !$mpGuildStanding>><<set $mpGuildStanding to {}>><</if>>
<<for _jKey range ["bakery", "cafe", "fish", "spa", "farm", "clock", "laundry", "tailor", "courier", "pubkitchen", "stable", "trawler", "docks", "crafts", "service", "underground"]>>
	<<if $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] to 0>><</if>>
<</for>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.wageMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to 100>><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.tollMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpGuildStanding.policy>><<set $mpGuildStanding.policy to "none">><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildAdd">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _jKey to (_args[0] or "bakery")>>
<<set _amt to (_args[1] or 5)>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] to Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ($mpGuildStanding[_jKey] or 0) + _amt))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.docks to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.fish or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.trawler or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.pubkitchen or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.crafts to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.bakery or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.clock or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.tailor or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.service to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.cafe or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.spa or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.laundry or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.underground to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.courier or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.farm or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.stable or 0)) / 3))>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildVote">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _bill to (_args[0] or "wage")>>
<<set _stance to (_args[1] or "pass")>>
<<if _bill is "wage">><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to (_stance is "pass" ? 115 : 95)>><</if>>
<<if _bill is "curfew">><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to (_stance is "relax" ? 2 : -1)>><</if>>
<<if _bill is "toll">><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to (_stance is "cut" ? -8 : 10)>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildPolicy">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _pol to (_args[0] or "charter")>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.policy to _pol>>
<</widget>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
十二行会联席厅设在旧海关钟楼的三层，长窗正对着灰雾未散的海面。厅里没有主位，十二张窄桌围成一圈，桌角各钉一枚铜牌：面包、咖啡、鱼档、浴场、农庄、钟表、洗衣、裁缝、信差、酒馆后厨、马厩、拖网船。四面的高背廊台分属海港、百工、侍奉与暗流四帮，廊柱上依次挂着船锚、铁锤、酒盏与车轮的旧旗，旗面被煤烟熏得发硬，边角用麻线草草缝过。
<br><br>
联席不设常任主席，只有一本摊在中央的厚账册。每一页记一条零工的出勤与声望，翻过三页归到一个帮口，四个帮口再在议案上互相别苗头。执事把蘸水笔搁在账脊上，声音不高：「十二席都在等一个数。数够了，议案才有人附议；数不够，说破嘴也只是空响。」他抬眼看你，又把账册往你面前推了半寸。
<br>
【联席账册】工钱倍率：<<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>% ｜ 百钱物价：<<mpWorldPrice 100>> ｜ 营业窗：<<mpWorldScheduleOpen 8 21>> ｜ 宵禁修正：<<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>> ｜ 港税修正：<<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>
<br>
【十二席声望】面包 <<print $mpGuildStanding.bakery>> ｜ 咖啡 <<print $mpGuildStanding.cafe>> ｜ 鱼档 <<print $mpGuildStanding.fish>> ｜ 浴场 <<print $mpGuildStanding.spa>> ｜ 农庄 <<print $mpGuildStanding.farm>> ｜ 钟表 <<print $mpGuildStanding.clock>> ｜ 洗衣 <<print $mpGuildStanding.laundry>> ｜ 裁缝 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tailor>> ｜ 信差 <<print $mpGuildStanding.courier>> ｜ 后厨 <<print $mpGuildStanding.pubkitchen>> ｜ 马厩 <<print $mpGuildStanding.stable>> ｜ 拖网 <<print $mpGuildStanding.trawler>>
<br>
【四帮均势】海港 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>> ｜ 百工 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>> ｜ 侍奉 <<print $mpGuildStanding.service>> ｜ 暗流 <<print $mpGuildStanding.underground>>
<br>
【当下世相】宪章走向：<<if $mpGuildStanding.policy is "charter">>百工自治宪章<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.policy is "freeport">>自由港商贸同盟<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.policy is "shadow">>灰市影子议会<<else>>尚未落定<</if>> ｜ 码头夜闸：<<if $mpGuildStanding.tollMod gte 10>>重税查验<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod gte 2 or $mpGuildStanding.tollMod lte -8>>放行<<else>>按时关闭<</if>>
<br><br>
海港帮盯着潮汐与泊位，百工帮盯着工钱与本地货，侍奉帮盯着夜里的灯与客，暗流帮盯着宵禁与暗巷。工钱案上，百工与侍奉同阵，海港与暗流同阵；宵禁案上，侍奉与暗流要宽，百工与海港要严；港税案上，海港与侍奉要减，百工与暗流要加。四帮没有永久的盟友，只有下一本账。
<br><br>
厅外的雾贴着窗玻璃往上爬，楼下传来卸货与收摊的动静，像是全城都在等这本账翻页。你把账册翻到今日这一页，纸角还留着上一任执事的铅笔痕：一行是工钱，一行是钟点，一行是闸口。三行字都很短，落在全城却很长。
<br><br>
账册的规矩很直：十二席的声望先垫成帮口的均势，帮口过了六席，才有人替议案附议；工钱倍率写在右页，物价与营业窗写在左页，港税那一栏又同时牵着闸口与铺面。你先看数，再决定替哪边说话。执事把笔递过来，笔尖还沾着上一页的墨。
<br><br>
神殿的晨钟、孤儿院的送饭车、节日前后的采买，还有阿什的巡林、莫奈的画室、诺艾尔的药圃、维斯的夜航，最后都会化成这十二席上的一笔出勤。雾潮涨一寸，码头的班次就少一班；节庆前多卖一车货，面包房与后厨的席位就厚一分。四帮的账从来不是关起门来算的。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街布告 (0:02)|MP Town Side Stories Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[查看四大派系 (0:04)|MP Guild Bloc Overview]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[表决工钱议案 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Wage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[表决宵禁议案 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Curfew]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<link [[表决港税议案 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Toll]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
